{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02636","headline":"策杖寻隐士 · 王绩","name":"策杖寻隐士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"策杖寻隐士，行行路渐赊。\n石梁横涧断，土室映山斜。\n孝然纵有舍，威辇遂无家。\n置酒烧枯叶，披书坐落花。\n新垂滋水钓，旧结茂陵罝。\n岁岁长如此，方知轻世华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}